<title>BELGIUM: EU clears Swiss RE control of Prudential's M &amp; G.</title>
<headline>EU clears Swiss RE control of Prudential's M &amp; G.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Monday it had approved an operation under which Schweizer Rueckversicherungs-Gesellschaft will acquire sole control of Mercantile and General Reinsurance Co from Britain's Prudential Group.  </p>
<p>The Commission said the Swiss company's worldwide share after the operation would be below 15 percent of the reinsurance market and therefore the operation would not lead to the creation of a dominant position.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
